{"ID":"20240205153912-sov625c","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153912-sov625c","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153912-sov625c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112344-yoogdb4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607093811-w9qwv01\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1879,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614165959-pl6nesh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"020鞠华（菊花）","type":"doc","updated":"20240801111538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206112344-yoogdb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112344-yoogdb4","updated":"20240206112345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"菊花"}]},{"ID":"20240206112329-egcucco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112329-egcucco","updated":"20240206112339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于浙江、安徽等地。\n【性状】\t杭菊：花序扁球形、不规则球形或稍压扁，直径多1.54cm。总苞由34层苞片组成，外围为数层舌状花，类白色或黄色，中央为管状花。气清香，味甘、微苦。\n亳菊：呈倒圆锥形或圆筒形，有时稍压扁呈扇状，直径1.53cm。离散。舌状花位于外围，雌性，类白色或淡黄白色，劲直，上举。散生金黄色腺点。管状花多数，两性，位于中央，常为舌状花所隐藏，黄色，顶端5齿裂。体轻，质柔润。气清香，味甘，微苦。贡菊：舌状花白色或类白色，总苞碟状；总苞片45层，三角状卵形，绿色，蒂绿，花心小，均匀不散朵，质柔软，气芳香，味甘微苦。\n滁菊：呈不规则球形或扁球形，直径1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.5cm，舌状花类白色，不规则扭曲，内卷，边缘皱缩，有时可见淡褐色的腺点，管状花大多隐藏。是菊花中花瓣最为紧密的一种。\n【性味】\t苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，平肝明目；疏风散热。"}]},{"ID":"20240206112329-pvgco6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112329-pvgco6x","updated":"20240206112329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112329-f2at62x.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data"